msgid "Take a 20-question exam on the IBM Training site to test your quantum information skills and receive a badge through Credly."
msgstr "Slož 20otázkovou zkoušku na webu IBM Training, otestuj své znalosti kvantové informace a získej odznak přes Credly."

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
